        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&quot;data&quot;:&quot;@startuml\nskinparam rectangle {\n  RoundCorner 10\n  FontSize 11\n  FontColor #1A2235\n}\nskinparam arrow {\n  Color #0D9488\n  FontColor #0D9488\n  FontSize 10\n}\nskinparam defaultFontName DM Sans\n\ntitle Gemini + FAISS RAG Chatbot Architecture\n\n&#39; ── Phase 1: Offline Indexing ─────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Phase 1 — Offline Indexing (Server Startup)**\&quot; as Phase1 #EEFAF5 {\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Admin**\\nPopulates chatbot_faqs\\ntable (Q&amp;A pairs)\&quot; as Admin #D0F5EC\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**EmbeddingService**\\nparaphrase-multilingual\\nMiniLM-L12-v2\&quot; as Embed #D0F5EC\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**FAISS IndexFlatIP**\\nIn-memory vector store\\n(inner product search)\&quot; as FAISS #D0F5EC\n\n}\n\n&#39; ── Phase 2: Online Inference ─────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**Phase 2 — Online Inference (Per Request)**\&quot; as Phase2 #F5FDFB {\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Student Query**\\n(Chat Widget)\&quot; as Query #FFE0D0\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Fetch Student Data**\\nAttendance, CGPA\\nCourses, Fee, Grades\&quot; as FetchDB #FFFDE7\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Encode Query**\\nSame sentence-transformer\\n→ query vector\&quot; as EncodeQ #D0F5EC\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**FAISS Search**\\nTop-3 similar FAQs\\nsimilarity &gt; 0.35\&quot; as Search #D0F5EC\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Build Prompt**\\nStudent context +\\nFAQ context + Query\&quot; as Prompt #EDE0FF\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Gemini API**\\ngemini-2.5-flash\\nGenerate response\&quot; as Gemini #FFF9C4\n\n  rectangle \&quot;**Save &amp; Return**\\nSave to conversation\\nhistory → Student\&quot; as Return #D0F5EC\n\n}\n\n&#39; ── Key Manager ───────────────────────────────────\nrectangle \&quot;**API Key Rotation Manager**\\nMultiple Gemini keys\\nAuto-switch on quota exceeded\&quot; as KeyMgr #FFE8E8\n\n&#39; ── Phase 1 Flow ──────────────────────────────────\nAdmin  -right-&gt; Embed : FAQ texts\nEmbed  -right-&gt; FAISS : Store vectors\\nat startup\n\n&#39; ── Phase 2 Flow ──────────────────────────────────\nQuery   -down-&gt; FetchDB  : student_id\nQuery   -down-&gt; EncodeQ  : message text\nFetchDB -down-&gt; Prompt   : student context\nEncodeQ -down-&gt; Search   : query vector\nFAISS   -down-&gt; Search   : similarity search\nSearch  -down-&gt; Prompt   : top-3 FAQ chunks\nPrompt  -down-&gt; Gemini   : structured prompt\nKeyMgr  -right-&gt; Gemini  : active API key\nGemini  -down-&gt; Return   : AI response\n\n&#39; ── Phase link ────────────────────────────────────\nFAISS -down-&gt; Search : used in\\nonline phase\n\n@enduml&quot;,&quot;format&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;}" id="14pVjtuajESJFR7WagT--21">
